
## 🚀 Deployment Commands

```bash
# Initialize Eagle Eye Repository
git init
git add .
git commit -m "🦅 SAFEWAY GUARDIAN v1.0.0 - SG QUANTUM EAGLE EYE with Triple World Surveillance"

# Create and push to GitHub
gh repo create sg-quantum-eagle-eye --public --description "Quantum Eagle Eye with Three World Monitoring Framework"
